-- WoW Forever: Blizzard's hotfixes of 25-26 November 2026 over client build 1.60.1.71139.
-- Records from Everlake (buildthehomelab/wow-trinitycore-everlake 1da1b8dd, GPL-3.0, with credit and thanks), from their
-- tracker's checkout of step 71139+1, Blizzard's values unchanged. Only the rows that are new
-- since step 71091+1 (2026_11_24_90) and that hotfixes_ptr did not already hold exactly, compared row by row on 26 November.
-- What they bring (Icy Veins' hotfix notes of 25 November, as stored by the tracker):
--   Druid Balance: Improved Wrath 16814 -> Starlight Wrath (also cuts Starfire's cast time), Improved Moonfire 16821 ->
--     Moon and Stars (Starfire pushback protection), Improved Starfire 16850 effect, Moonkin Form 24905 aura effect,
--     Eclipse 408248 Wrath crit effect, Dreamstate 408258, Genesis 1223081 (Hurricane/Tranquility).
--   Rogue poisons bind on pickup for now (Deadly, Instant, Crippling, Mind-numbing, Wound, Occult; Blinding Powder 5530
--     is back to its old binding in the latest hotfix, as the server's file has it, so it needs no row), Encrypted Twilight Text 20404,
--     Don Rodrigo's Band 21563 for every class, Unforged Rune Covered Breastplate 12806, other item and spell records of the day.
--   Lord Valthalak Laid to Rest Legacy achievement 64014 with its criteria; Exalted PvP Legacy criteria trees.
--   11 records Blizzard removed that day (hotfix_data Status 2): spell_aura_options, spell_shapeshift, spell_target_restrictions.
-- Not here: Spell (descriptions) and TalentTab have no hotfix table on this core, so talent tooltips keep the client's text.
-- Server-side-only changes of the notes (Dreamstate's Innervate share, Eclipse/Moonkin scripts, talent reset for
-- Improved Starfire 3+ points) carry no client record and are not in this file.
-- Layouts: every table here has the layout of the server's 71091 files (the checkout writes only such tables).
-- Our 71091 rows are 2026_11_25_70; any older hotfix_data row for the same records is replaced.
-- hotfix_data ids 2106537-2106823 are ours. Safe to run again.

